<title>USA: Zitel Corp names Larry Schlenoff CFO.</title>
<headline>Zitel Corp names Larry Schlenoff CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zitel Corp said Thursday it appointed  Larry Schlenoff vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Zitel said Schlenoff joins Zitel from International Business Machines  Corp.</p>
<p>He assumes his post today, replacing Henry Harris. The company said  Harris was promoted to senior vice president of strategic planning  and alliances.</p>
<p>The company said it also promoted James Hogan to vice president and  general manager of the storage division. Hogan was previously vice  president of worldwide sales and marketing.</p>
</text>
